            "title": "Lesson #2 - Copy - Copy - Copy",
            "id": 131977,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Completa il codice per recuperare la variabile d'ambiente <code>\"MY_API_KEY\"</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"import\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" os\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"api_key = os.getenv(\" /><text value=\"&quot;MY_API_KEY&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(api_key)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"24\" endIndex=\"30\" /><option startIndex=\"21\" endIndex=\"23\" /><option startIndex=\"23\" endIndex=\"24\" /><option startIndex=\"7\" endIndex=\"9\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"environ\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"12345-abcde-67890-fghij-12345\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>os</code>, seguito da <code>os</code> e poi <code>.</code>, <code>getenv</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Completa il codice per recuperare la variabile d'ambiente <code>\"MY_API_KEY\"</code>.</p><p>Importa il modulo richiesto, memorizza la chiave recuperata in <code>api_key</code> e stampala.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"import\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" os\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"api_key = os.getenv(\" /><text value=\"&quot;MY_API_KEY&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(api_key)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"7\" endIndex=\"9\" /><option startIndex=\"11\" endIndex=\"18\" /><option startIndex=\"21\" endIndex=\"30\" /><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"43\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"sys\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"os.environ\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;API_KEY&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"key\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"12345-abcde-67890-fghij-12345\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>os</code>, seguito da <code>api_key</code>, <code>os.getenv</code> e infine <code>\"MY_API_KEY\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10 - Copy",
            "id": 131982,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Questo codice stamperà la variabile <code>api_key</code> supponendo che non esista alcuna variabile d'ambiente con la chiave <code>\"NON_EXISTENT_KEY\"</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"import\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" os\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"api_key = os.environ[\" /><text value=\"&quot;NON_EXISTENT_KEY&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(api_key)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"KeyError: &quot;NON_EXISTENT_KEY&quot;\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">No, perché genera un errore <code>KeyError: \"NON_EXISTENT_KEY\"</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Sì, stamperà la chiave recuperata</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">No, non succederà nulla</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">No, perché genera un errore <code>KeyError: \"NON_EXISTENT_KEY\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Sostituisci la ricerca con <code>os.environ.get(\"NON_EXISTENT_KEY\", \"missing\")</code>.</p><p>La chiave è ancora assente. Cosa mostra ora <code>print(api_key)</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"import\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" os\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"api_key = os.environ[\" /><text value=\"&quot;NON_EXISTENT_KEY&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(api_key)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"KeyError: &quot;NON_EXISTENT_KEY&quot;\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>missing</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Un <code>KeyError</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>None</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>missing</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
