          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 131983,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quando devi usare <code>dotenv</code> nel tuo progetto?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Quando vuoi caricare le variabili d'ambiente da un file <code>.env</code> nella tua applicazione</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Quando le tue variabili d'ambiente sono già configurate nel sistema o nella piattaforma su cui stai lavorando, come Mimo</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Quando vuoi caricare le variabili d'ambiente da un file <code>.env</code> nella tua applicazione.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>La prima app conserva le variabili solo in <code>.env</code>. La seconda le riceve già caricate dalla piattaforma.</p><p>Quale app richiede <code>dotenv</code> per caricare le variabili prima di leggerle?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Solo la prima app</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Solo la seconda app</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Entrambe le app ne hanno sempre bisogno</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere Solo la prima app.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5 - Copy - Copy",
            "id": 131978,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Importa la libreria corretta per abilitare l'uso di <code>load_dotenv</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"import\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" dotenv\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"import\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" os\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"dotenv.load_dotenv()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"api_key = os.getenv(\" /><text value=\"&quot;API_KEY&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(api_key)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"7\" endIndex=\"13\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"12345-abcde-67890-fghij-12345\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>dotenv</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4 - Copy - Copy",
            "id": 131979,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Usa il metodo corretto per stampare tutte le variabili d'ambiente disponibili.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"import\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" os\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(os.environ)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"19\" /><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"20\" /><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"27\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"getenv\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;API_KEY&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\")\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"environ({\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  &quot;API_KEY&quot;: &quot;12345-abcde-67890-fghij-12345&quot;,\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  &quot;SECRET_KEY&quot;: &quot;mysecretkey&quot;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  ...\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"})\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>os</code>, seguito da <code>.</code> e infine <code>environ</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Usa il dizionario di ambiente per leggere <code>API_KEY</code>, poi stampa tutte le variabili di ambiente disponibili.</p><p>Memorizza il dizionario in <code>variables</code>. Stampa prima il valore della chiave e poi il dizionario completo.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"import\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"os\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"variables\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"os\" /><text value=\".\" /><text value=\"environ\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"variables\" /><text value=\"[\" /><text value=\"&quot;API_KEY&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"variables\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"23\" endIndex=\"25\" /><option startIndex=\"26\" endIndex=\"33\" /><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"59\" /><option startIndex=\"68\" endIndex=\"77\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"getenv\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;SECRET_KEY&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"variables[&quot;API_KEY&quot;]\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"12345-abcde-67890-fghij-12345\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"environ({\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  &quot;API_KEY&quot;: &quot;12345-abcde-67890-fghij-12345&quot;,\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  &quot;SECRET_KEY&quot;: &quot;mysecretkey&quot;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  ...\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"})\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>os</code>, seguito da <code>environ</code>, <code>\"API_KEY\"</code> e infine <code>variables</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4 - Copy -  - Copy - Copy",
            "id": 131980,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Assicurati di impostare un valore predefinito nel caso in cui il dizionario <code>os.environ</code> non contenga quello che stiamo cercando.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"import\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" os\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"api_key = os.environ.get(\" /><text value=\"&quot;NON_EXISTENT_KEY&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;default_value&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(api_key)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"32\" endIndex=\"35\" /><option startIndex=\"36\" endIndex=\"54\" /><option startIndex=\"54\" endIndex=\"55\" /><option startIndex=\"56\" endIndex=\"71\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"getenv\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"default_value\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>get</code>, seguito da <code>\"NON_EXISTENT_KEY\"</code> e poi <code>,</code>, <code>\"default_value\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Imposta un valore predefinito nel caso in cui il dizionario <code>os.environ</code> non contenga la chiave necessaria.</p><p>Recupera <code>NON_EXISTENT_KEY</code> in modo sicuro affinché il programma stampi <code>default_value</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"import\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" os\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"api_key = os.environ.get(\" /><text value=\"&quot;NON_EXISTENT_KEY&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;default_value&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(api_key)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"21\" endIndex=\"31\" /><option startIndex=\"32\" endIndex=\"35\" /><option startIndex=\"36\" endIndex=\"54\" /><option startIndex=\"56\" endIndex=\"71\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"os.getenv\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"set\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;MY_API_KEY&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;missing&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"default_value\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>os.environ</code>, seguito da <code>get</code>, <code>\"NON_EXISTENT_KEY\"</code> e infine <code>\"default_value\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
